File Index

/eq-delta-parse.ts
Purpose: Parses equipment change messages from game client into structured events.

/eq-parse.ts
Purpose: Parses equipment snapshot data from text lines into structured format.

/equipment-idb.ts
Purpose: Manages equipment profiles storage and retrieval using IndexedDB.

/equipment-store.ts
Purpose: Manages equipment state, preferences, and profiles with local storage and IndexedDB persistence.

/equipment-text.ts
Purpose: Processes and cleans equipment item names by removing ANSI codes and status prefixes.

/equipment-types.ts
Purpose: Defines TypeScript types for equipment slots, states, and related data structures in the game client.
